{"step_index":177,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-07T20:41:13Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-08T02:11:13+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-09-08T02:11:13+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/backend/app/utils/config.py`\nTotal Lines: 39\nTotal Bytes: 1119\nShowing lines 1 to 39\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: \"\"\"NEXUS Backend Configuration.\"\"\"\n2: from typing import List\n3: from pydantic_settings import BaseSettings, SettingsConfigDict\n4: \n5: \n6: class Settings(BaseSettings):\n7:     PROJECT_NAME: str = \"NEXUS Law Enforcement & Intelligence Platform\"\n8:     PROJECT_DESCRIPTION: str = (\n9:         \"NEXUS Backend API - Prototype Intelligence & Pattern Analysis System. \"\n10:         \"Powered by Synthetic Investigation Datasets for ethical analysis.\"\n11:     )\n12:     VERSION: str = \"1.0.0\"\n13:     API_V1_STR: str = \"/api\"\n14:     DEBUG: bool = True\n15:     \n16:     # CORS Origins\n17:     CORS_ORIGINS: str = (\n18:         \"http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:5173,http://127.0.0.1:3000\"\n19:     )\n20:     \n21:     # Database\n22:     DATABASE_URL: str = \"sqlite:///./nexus.db\"\n23:     \n24:     # Dataset attribution\n25:     DATASET_LABEL: str = \"Synthetic Investigation Dataset\"\n26: \n27:     model_config = SettingsConfigDict(\n28:         env_file=\".env\",\n29:         env_file_encoding=\"utf-8\",\n30:         extra=\"ignore\"\n31:     )\n32: \n33:     @property\n34:     def cors_origins_list(self) -> List[str]:\n35:         return [origin.strip() for origin in self.CORS_ORIGINS.split(\",\") if origin.strip()]\n36: \n37: \n38: settings = Settings()\n39: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
